                    getAppGroupId(), getAppArtifactId(), appVersion)
            }

        } else if (buildType == 'gradle') {

            // Gradle flow – no pom.xml reading
            println "INFO: Gradle project detected — uploading Gradle JAR"

            nexusArtifactoryUpload(
